  "notes": "UK trap metal’s chart-side pioneer — screamed vocals, claustrophobic beats. The parameter is fusion: **the 808 and the guitar are mixed as one instrument**, extremely distorted, medium decay, in unison with the riff, and the kick pattern *doubles the guitar’s rhythmic hits* rather than running its own figure. Harmony is deliberately minimal — static i or `i–VI–VII` on drop-tuned power chords with tritone accents, riff-only, no pad and no countermelody. ⚠ `medium`: style, label and chart status are sourced; per-track parameters are not.",
